<title>JAPAN: BIATHLON-WORLD CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>BIATHLON-WORLD CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>NOZAWA ONSEN, Japan 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Cup</p>
<p>biathlon events on Sunday:</p>
<p>Mens 4 x 7.5km relay</p>
<p>  1. Russia     one hour 30 minutes 3.5 seconds/5 penalty laps</p>
<p>  2. Norway     1:31:08.9/6</p>
<p>  3. Slovenia   1:31:23.3/9</p>
<p>  4. Austria    1:32:18.2/15</p>
<p>  5. Germany    1:32:38.1/9</p>
